    <name>Passo dello Stelvio</name>
    <desc>The eastern ramp of the Stelvio Pass road from Prato allo Stelvio: 48 hairpins up to 2757 m, South Tyrol, Italy. Demo track: geometry from OpenStreetMap, elevations from AWS Terrain Tiles. Timestamps are synthesized with a constant-power cycling model; this is not a real recording.</desc>
